    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down endless hordes of enemies while crafting your most powerful build to survive until the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices\u2014what weapons you pick and how you play\u2014can completely change the outcome, making every run a new adventure you'll want to play again and again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the onslaught until time runs out!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/extras/bdb347a260a1e0d23b9bbcf56968dc05.avif?t=1751256033\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine each character's unique skills with a wide variety of weapons to create your ultimate build and crush the approaching enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock weapons and power-ups in the shop and upgrade your parameters to broaden your strategy options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up with Lucky Boxes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/extras/143429224f1e5f3023c45ce5db6ccf70.avif?t=1751256033\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated enemies may drop Lucky Boxes. Open one to spin a slot and get a chance to power up your weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger massive level-ups and turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-slot machine support system!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/extras/36452e3095a64e8aa24fd8adf16fced0.avif?t=1751256033\" width=636 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the mini-slot at the bottom of the screen lands a match, items will appear on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you get\u2014and when\u2014depends entirely on how you fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it that upgrading your &quot;Luck&quot; makes it easier to win big!?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down endless hordes of enemies while crafting your most powerful build to survive until the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices\u2014what weapons you pick and how you play\u2014can completely change the outcome, making every run a new adventure you'll want to play again and again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the onslaught until time runs out!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/extras/bdb347a260a1e0d23b9bbcf56968dc05.avif?t=1751256033\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine each character's unique skills with a wide variety of weapons to create your ultimate build and crush the approaching enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock weapons and power-ups in the shop and upgrade your parameters to broaden your strategy options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up with Lucky Boxes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/extras/143429224f1e5f3023c45ce5db6ccf70.avif?t=1751256033\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated enemies may drop Lucky Boxes. Open one to spin a slot and get a chance to power up your weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger massive level-ups and turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-slot machine support system!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243710/extras/36452e3095a64e8aa24fd8adf16fced0.avif?t=1751256033\" width=636 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the mini-slot at the bottom of the screen lands a match, items will appear on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you get\u2014and when\u2014depends entirely on how you fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it that upgrading your &quot;Luck&quot; makes it easier to win big!?</p>",
